{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02727","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 上官仪","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上路抵平津，後堂罗荐陈。\n缔交开狎赏，丽席展芳辰。\n密树风烟积，回塘荷芰新。\n雨霁虹桥晚，花落凤台春。\n翠钗低舞席，文杏散歌尘。\n方惜流觞满，夕鸟已城闉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}